# Design

Vision Studio looks like a music instrument. The ground is `#0F0F10`. Panels are `#161617`. Raised controls are `#1E1E20`. Hairlines are `#2A2A2D` at 1px. Primary text is `#EDEDED`. Secondary text is `#9A9A9F`. Every text pair is at least 4.5 to 1. On the signal colour, text is `#0F0F10`.

One signal colour, orange `#FF5A1F`, is used only for the primary action, the active step, focus, and the playhead. Lane colours are muted and appear only on audio and layer pads: drums `#E0533D`, chords `#E3B341`, bass `#2FA37C`, melody `#4C7DFF`, texture `#9B6BFF`. The pad stays dark. The colour is its edge and its waveform. Full mix has no sixth hue.

Do not use purple gradients, glass, backdrop blur, gradient text, a hero greeting, chat bubbles, confidence meters, or decorative icons.

General Sans is the interface. Martian Mono is every readout: tempo, key, bars, step numbers, file names, and the trace. Both are self hosted, General Sans from Fontshare and Martian Mono from Fontsource. Sentence case. No all caps. Tabular numbers. Sizes are 13, 15, 20, and 32px. 56px is only the tempo and key readouts.

Radius is 6px on controls and 10px on panels. Spacing stays on a 4px grid. Focus is a 1px signal outline. Motion is 120 to 180ms and mechanical. Steps snap in. A small LED blinks while thinking. Reduced motion makes those instant and holds the LED steady.

The transport spans the top: wordmark, session name, tempo, key, bars, status (idle, thinking, building, ready, or error), and Build in signal orange. The left rail is 01 Create, 02 Genres, 03 Analyse, 04 Tweak, then recent ideas. Analyse and Tweak say Soon when those flags are off. Create is a large input with a segmented "A full idea" / "One sound" switch and square Attach and Record buttons, then numbered steps on a vertical hairline. The right panel is a two-column parameter grid (label, mono value, source tag: you, detected, default, or reference), facets under their layer, the trace, then layer pads. Results are horizontal lanes with waveforms in the lane colour on the dark ground, play, three take buttons, Pick, and Another take.

The empty Create screen fits at 1280×800 and 1440×900 without page scrolling. Under 1200px the right panel becomes tabs. Under 768px the left rail is a drawer. Record, solo and mute, full mix, the styleguide link, the demo control, and the Soon items follow `apps/web/src/features.ts`.
